<https://github.com/john1hsu/ai-knowledge-graph/id/flash-attention> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A family of IO-aware GPU kernels that compute exact softmax attention by tiling queries, keys and values through fast on-chip SRAM with an online softmax, so the full sequence-by-sequence attention matrix is never written to slow high-bandwidth memory; it cuts attention memory to linear in sequence length and speeds up both training and inference." .
