<https://github.com/john1hsu/ai-knowledge-graph/id/react-prompting> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A prompting paradigm, introduced by Yao et al. (Google Research, ICLR 2023), in which a language model interleaves free-form reasoning traces (\"thoughts\") with actions such as search or tool calls and reads back the resulting observations, so reasoning guides actions and external feedback grounds reasoning." .
